  "title": "createElement and append",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## Grow the tree\n\n`document.createElement(\"li\")` makes a node that is not on the page yet. Set `textContent`, then `ul.append(li)` to hang it on the list. `li.remove()` takes a node off.\n\nDo not concatenate HTML strings to add one item. On this tray, the beacon log starts empty. Create an `li` that says `East` and append it to `#list`."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "id": "append-parent",
      "promptMd": "After `ul.append(li)`, `li.parentNode` is…",
      "kind": "mcq",
